# Build artifacts
target/

# Git metadata
.git/
.gitignore

# GitHub metadata
.github/

# Documentation (not needed for the build)
docs/
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
LICENSE
AGENTS.md

# CI / local testing scripts and integration tooling. The OpenFGA model is a
